flowchart TD
  Baseline[Review and approve baseline command] --> Run[Run actual check]
  Run -->|fails meaningfully| Candidate[Propose bounded Python change]
  Run -->|already passes| Already[Already passing]
  Candidate --> Review[Review exact diff and digest]
  Review --> Apply[Approve and apply]
  Apply --> Check[Review and approve verification]
  Check --> Result[Run actual check on current snapshot]
  Result -->|passes| Done[Repaired]
  Result -->|fails within attempt budget| Candidate
